cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Unsupervised Solder-Defect Detection on PCBs with PatchCore and a Shared-Backbone Architecture"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fagundes
    given-names: Andrei Edio
date-released: 2026-11-30
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/andreifagds/pcb-solder-anomaly-detection"
keywords:
  - anomaly detection
  - PatchCore
  - DINOv2
  - printed circuit board
  - solder inspection
  - automated optical inspection
abstract: >-
  Per-region PatchCore models for solder-defect inspection on PCB panels, with a
  frozen DINOv2 backbone shared by every region model so that 130 models fit on a
  6 GB GPU (-90% VRAM) with scores identical to the reference implementation.
  Final project of the Computer Vision Master (VC MASTER) course, ICA / PUC-Rio.
